[83.595767,"o","   or: busybox --install [-s] [DIR]\n"]
[83.595784,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[83.595801,"o","\n"]
[83.595818,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[83.595835,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[83.595852,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[83.595869,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[83.595886,"o","\n"]
