[99.28791,"o","\n"]
[99.287927,"o","Usage: busybox [function] [arguments]...\n"]
[99.287943,"o","   or: busybox --list[-full]\n"]
[99.287961,"o","   or: busybox --install [-s] [DIR]\n"]
[99.287977,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[99.287994,"o","\n"]
[99.288011,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[99.288028,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[99.288045,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[99.288062,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
